<body>

{% include "_site_nav.html.j2" %}

<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>{{ t('Top Picks', '精选股') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted sm">{{ t('holistic conviction across the S&P 1500 — ranked by what to own, flagged for when to buy', '覆盖标普 1500 的综合信念 — 按“持有什么”排名，并标注“何时买入”') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    "Two separate questions, deliberately kept apart. CONVICTION (the rank) is how good the name looks: mostly how far it is outrunning its own sector, confirmed by value, quality, profitability, low volatility and insider buying. BUY (its own column) is whether you can act today — a name only reads 'Buy zone' once the entry signal has actually fired, or is about to. A high-conviction leader that is rolling over is NOT a buy; it shows a muted dash. The 'trend' chip tells you how much risk to take, never whether to buy, and it never touches the rank — folding timing into the rank measurably hurt when we tested it. The blend beat momentum alone at every horizon we measured, but the edge is modest and crowded: this is a research lens with an entry check attached, not a guaranteed buy list.",
    "两件事，我们有意分开说。信念（排名）说的是这只股票本身好不好：主要看它跑赢自己所在行业多少，再用价值、质量、盈利能力、低波动和内部人买入来确认。买入（单独一列）说的是今天能不能动手——只有入场信号真的触发了、或者马上要触发，才会显示“买入区”。一只信念很高但已经在回落的领涨股不是买点，那里会显示一个灰色破折号。“趋势”标签只告诉你该冒多大风险，不代表买卖，也完全不参与排名——我们测过，把择时折进排名反而更差。这套组合在我们测过的每个时间跨度上都好于只看动量，但优势有限、也很拥挤：它是一个带入场检查的研究视角，不是保证赚钱的买入清单。") }}</p>
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ t('As of', '截至') }} {{ as_of }} · {{ n }} {{ t('names', '只') }} ·
    {{ t('score', '评分') }} {{ alpha_w }}·α + {{ tilt_w }}·{{ t('conviction', '信念') }} ·
    {{ t('betas', '贝塔') }} {{ windows.beta_win }}d · {{ t('formation', '形成窗口') }} {{ windows.form }}-{{ windows.skip }}d</p>
</div>

{% if banner and banner.state and banner.state != 'na' %}
<div class="cohort {{ banner.state }}">
  <span class="dot"></span>
  <span><b>{{ t('Leadership cohort', '领先股群体') }}:</b>
    {% if banner.state == 'stretched' %}{{ t('stretched', '过度拉伸') }}{% elif banner.state == 'elevated' %}{{ t('elevated', '偏高') }}{% else %}{{ t('normal', '正常') }}{% endif %}</span>
  <span class="muted sm">{{ banner.pct_stretched }}% {{ t('stretched / parabolic', '拉伸/抛物') }} ·
    {{ t('median extension', '中位拉伸') }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(banner.median_ext_z) }}σ ·
    {{ banner.pct_at_highs }}% {{ t('pressing highs', '逼近新高') }}</span>
  {{ help('How stretched the top-conviction leaders are versus their OWN history. A fragility / size-DOWN gauge for the whole book — crowding and stretch raise crash *probability*, they do NOT time the market (we tested: no extension screen reduces drawdown, and narrow markets can grind higher for a long time). Never a fade, never changes the rank. When stretched, prefer smaller size and in-trend names over parabolic ones.', '顶端高信念领先股相对其自身历史的拉伸程度。面向整体仓位的脆弱性/减仓提示——拥挤与拉伸提高崩跌“概率”，但并不择时（我们验证过：任何拉伸筛选都不会降低回撤）。绝非反向做空，也不改变排名。拉伸时宜减小仓位、偏好趋势内而非抛物个股。') }}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="panel">
  <h2>{{ t('Buy-zone picks', '可建仓精选') }}
    {{ help('The sweet spot: high-conviction Top Picks whose entry signal has also actually fired, or is about to. A name only appears here if it is genuinely buyable today — a strong name that is rolling over is not shown, however high its conviction.', '最佳交集：既是高信念精选，入场信号也确实已经触发、或者马上要触发。只有今天确实能买的标的才会出现在这里——无论信念多高，已经在回落的就不显示。') }}</h2>
  {% if buyzone %}
  <div class="bz-strip">
    {% for r in buyzone %}
    <div class="bz-card">
      <div class="bz-head">
        <span class="tk"><a href="stock.html#{{ r.ticker }}">{{ r.ticker }}</a></span>
        <span class="bz-score">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.top_score) }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="muted xs" style="margin:1px 0 6px">{{ r.name[:24] }} · {{ td(r.sector) }} · α {{ '%+.2f'|format(r.alpha) }}{% if r.sector_rank %} #{{ r.sector_rank }}/{{ r.sector_n }}{% endif %}</div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap">{{ signal(r) }}{{ stretch(r) }}{{ entry(r) }}{{ conv(r) }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if n_buyable and n_buyable > buyzone|length %}<p class="muted sm note">{{ t('+ %d more name(s) with a fresh confluence buy below conviction %.1f — see the “buy” column in the table.'|format(n_buyable - buyzone|length, 0.3), '另有 %d 个已触发共振买入但信念低于 %.1f 的标的 — 见下表“买入”列。'|format(n_buyable - buyzone|length, 0.3)) }}</p>{% endif %}
  {% else %}
  <p class="muted sm note" style="margin:0">{{ t('Nothing has a fresh entry signal right now. That is the honest read — on most days very few actually fire, and this board will not invent a buy out of trend or momentum alone. Watch the “buy” column in the table below.', '目前没有标的出现新的入场信号。这是实话——大多数日子里真正触发的本来就很少，这个榜单不会仅凭趋势或动量硬凑出一个买点。请关注下表的“买入”一列。') }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tabbtn on" data-tab="global">{{ t('Top Picks', '精选') }}</button>
  <button class="tabbtn" data-tab="sectors">{{ t('Sectors', '板块') }}</button>
  <button class="tabbtn" data-tab="sector">{{ t('Sector index', '板块明细') }}</button>
</div>

<!-- TOP PICKS (global, ranked by conviction) -->
<div id="tab-global" data-grp="tab">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="seg">
      <button class="segbtn on" id="seg-strong">{{ t('Top conviction', '高信念') }}</button>
      <button class="segbtn" id="seg-weak">{{ t('Avoid', '回避') }}</button>
    </div>
    <label class="filt"><input type="checkbox" id="hideStretch">{{ t('Hide stretched / parabolic', '隐藏拉伸/抛物') }}
      {{ help('Hides leaders that are ≥1σ extended vs their own history (stretched or parabolic) — leaving the high-conviction names that are still in-trend or steady. A risk-placement filter for finding leaders earlier in their move; NOT a higher-return or lower-drawdown claim (we tested — see reports/top-picks-freshness-phase0.md).', '隐藏相对自身历史拉伸 ≥1σ 的领先股（拉伸或抛物），仅保留仍处趋势内/平稳的高信念个股。这是风险定位筛选，并非更高收益或更低回撤的承诺。') }}</label>
    {% set thead %}
      <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('Top-Pick score', '精选评分') }}{{ help('The conviction rank = 0.6·alpha + 0.4·confirmation. alpha is the sector-neutral residual-momentum z; confirmation is the sector-neutral z-mean of value / quality / profitability / low-vol / insider. Validated point-in-time to beat alpha alone on IC at every horizon (reports/top-picks-phase0.md). A modest, decayed edge — context, not a guaranteed buy.', '信念排名 = 0.6·阿尔法 + 0.4·确认。阿尔法为板块中性残差动量 z；确认为价值/质量/盈利/低波/内部人的板块中性 z 均值。经点对点验证在每个跨度上优于单独阿尔法（reports/top-picks-phase0.md）。温和、已衰减的边际信号——背景而非保证买入。') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('buy', '买入') }}{{ help('The entry signal you can actually act on. "Buy zone" = it fired in the last few days and momentum is still building; "About to cross" = it should fire within a day or two. A muted dash means nothing has fired — the name is a hold or is rolling over today, whatever its conviction. This is the only column that says "buy".', '真正能照着动手的入场信号。“买入区”＝最近几天刚触发，动量还在往上走；“即将交叉”＝预计一两天内触发。灰色破折号表示什么都没触发——不管信念多高，这只股票今天就是持有或者在回落。这是唯一说“买入”的一列。') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('stretch', '拉伸') }}{{ help('How far the name has run above its own 200-day average: In-trend → Steady → Stretched → ⚠Parabolic. The parabolic tail is the bubble-pullback flag — measured, that group went on to a −94% drawdown. It tells you how much risk to take: never part of the rank, and never a reason to short. We tested folding it into the score and it did not reduce drawdown, so it stays a per-name caution.', '这只股票比自己的 200 日均线高出多少：趋势内→平稳→拉伸→⚠抛物线。抛物线那一段是泡沫回撤的警示——实测下来，这一组后来出现了 −94% 的回撤。它只告诉你该冒多大风险：不计入排名，也不构成做空理由。我们试过把它折进评分，并没有减少回撤，所以它只作为单只股票的提醒。') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}{{ help('Trend-position CONTEXT (NOT a buy call, NOT in the rank): Pullback = a leader easing back toward its trend; In trend = riding it; Extended = just spiked (wait). This is where in its OWN move a leader sits — the actual buy trigger is the separate "buy" column (the confluence gate). A name can read "Pullback" here yet have no fresh cross.', '趋势位置情境（非买入信号、不计入排名）：回调=领先股回踩趋势；趋势内=延续；过热=刚飙升（等待）。这是领先股处于自身走势的哪个位置——真正的买入触发在单独的“买入”列（共振门控）。某股此处可显示“回调”却无新交叉。') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('conviction drivers', '信念驱动') }}{{ help('Which confirming legs move the score (sector-neutral z ≥ 0.6 or ≤ -0.6): Profit = gross profitability (the strongest confirmer), plus value / quality / low-vol. 👤N = N insiders bought. "Rich/Cheap vs own" = current earnings yield vs the name\'s own ~3y history (display-only).', '推动评分的确认因子（板块中性 z ≥ 0.6 或 ≤ -0.6）：Profit = 毛利率（最强确认），以及价值/质量/低波。👤N = N 名内部人买入。“相对自身偏高/偏低” = 当前市盈收益率相对该股近3年历史（仅展示）。') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('α', '阿尔法') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('price', '价格') }}</th></tr>
    {% endset %}
    <div id="g-strong" data-grp="glist">
      <table>{{ thead }}{% for r in strongest %}{{ trow(r, loop.index) }}{% endfor %}</table>
    </div>
    <div id="g-weak" data-grp="glist" style="display:none">
      <table>{{ thead }}{% for r in weakest %}{{ trow(r, loop.index) }}{% endfor %}</table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SECTORS OVERVIEW -->
<div id="tab-sectors" data-grp="tab" style="display:none">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Sectors by conviction', '按信念排序的板块') }}
      {{ help('GICS sectors ranked by the mean Top-Pick score of their names, with the share of each sector sitting in the universe-wide top quintile. Because the score is sector-neutral, this measures how broadly a sector is leading, not the sector ETF return.', '按其成分股的平均精选评分对 GICS 板块排序，并显示各板块处于全域顶部五分位的占比。由于评分为板块中性，这衡量的是板块领先的广度，而非板块 ETF 回报。') }}</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th><th>{{ t('mean score', '平均评分') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('in top 20%', '位于前20%') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('names', '只') }}</th></tr>
      {% for s in sectors %}
      <tr>
        <td class="rk">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td>{{ td(s.sector) }}</td>
        <td><div class="scorecell">{{ sbar(s.mean) }}<span class="znum band-{{ 'strong' if s.mean>=0.3 else 'lag' if s.mean<-0.3 else 'mid' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(s.mean) }}</span></div></td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ s.intop }}/{{ s.n }} · {{ s.pct }}%</td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ s.n }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SECTOR INDEX (drill) -->
<div id="tab-sector" data-grp="tab" style="display:none">
  <div class="panel">
    <select id="secsel" class="secsel">
      {% for sec in sector_order %}<option value="{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ sec }} ({{ by_sector[sec].n }})</option>{% endfor %}
    </select>
    {% for sec in sector_order %}
    <div id="sec-{{ loop.index0 }}" data-grp="seclist"{% if not loop.first %} style="display:none"{% endif %}>
      <div class="twocol">
        <div>
          <h3 class="pos">{{ t('Top picks', '精选') }} — {{ td(sec) }}</h3>
          <table>
            <tr><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('score', '评分') }}</th><th>{{ t('buy', '买入') }}</th><th>{{ t('stretch', '拉伸') }}</th><th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}</th><th>{{ t('drivers', '驱动') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('α', '阿尔法') }}</th></tr>
            {% for r in by_sector[sec].leaders %}{{ srow(r) }}{% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="neg">{{ t('Avoid', '回避') }} — {{ td(sec) }}</h3>
          <table>
            <tr><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('score', '评分') }}</th><th>{{ t('buy', '买入') }}</th><th>{{ t('stretch', '拉伸') }}</th><th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}</th><th>{{ t('drivers', '驱动') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('α', '阿尔法') }}</th></tr>
            {% for r in by_sector[sec].laggards %}{{ srow(r) }}{% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted sm note">{{ t('Re-ranked within each sector by the Top-Pick score. α is how far the name is outrunning its own sector; the score adds the other factors on top. The "buy" column is the entry signal you can act on; "trend" is where the name sits in its own move — a separate question.', '按精选评分在各自板块内重新排序。α 是它跑赢自己所在行业的幅度；评分在此基础上再加上其他因子。“买入”一列是可以照着动手的入场信号；“趋势”说的是它在自己这波走势里的位置——那是另一个问题。') }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0">{{ t(
    'Source: engine/top_picks.py — an alpha-led conviction blend (engine/residual_alpha.py + engine/equity_factors.py + Form-4 insider) over the S&P 1500, validated point-in-time in reports/top-picks-phase0.md. The stretch / exhaustion axis, valuation-vs-own-history chip and cohort banner (engine/extension.py) are DISPLAY-ONLY risk reads — never in the rank: a point-in-time downside test (reports/top-picks-freshness-phase0.md) found no extension screen reduces drawdown, but the parabolic (>2σ own-history) tail is a genuine bubble-pullback hazard, so it is flagged per-name. Ranks recompute daily with prices/filings. A modest, decayed, crowded edge — a research lens with risk context, not a buy list.',
    '来源：engine/top_picks.py — 覆盖标普 1500 的以阿尔法为主的信念混合（engine/residual_alpha.py + engine/equity_factors.py + Form-4 内部人），已在 reports/top-picks-phase0.md 做点对点验证。拉伸/过热维度、相对自身估值标签与群体横幅（engine/extension.py）均为仅展示的风险读数，不计入排名：点对点下行测试（reports/top-picks-freshness-phase0.md）发现任何拉伸筛选都无法降低回撤，但抛物（相对自身历史>2σ）尾部确为真实的泡沫回撤风险，故逐股标注。排名随价格/披露每日重算。温和、已衰减、拥挤的边际信号 — 带风险背景的研究视角，而非买入清单。') }}
    {{ t('Generated', '生成于') }} {{ built }}</p>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
 function show(id, grp){ document.querySelectorAll('[data-grp="'+grp+'"]').forEach(function(el){ el.style.display='none'; }); var el=document.getElementById(id); if(el) el.style.display=''; }
 document.querySelectorAll('.tabbtn').forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('click', function(){
   document.querySelectorAll('.tabbtn').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.remove('on'); }); this.classList.add('on');
   show('tab-'+this.dataset.tab, 'tab'); }); });
 var su=document.getElementById('seg-strong'), sw=document.getElementById('seg-weak');
 if(su&&sw){ su.addEventListener('click', function(){ su.classList.add('on'); sw.classList.remove('on'); show('g-strong','glist'); });
             sw.addEventListener('click', function(){ sw.classList.add('on'); su.classList.remove('on'); show('g-weak','glist'); }); }
 var sel=document.getElementById('secsel');
 if(sel) sel.addEventListener('change', function(){ show('sec-'+this.value, 'seclist'); });
 var hs=document.getElementById('hideStretch');
 if(hs) hs.addEventListener('change', function(){
   var hide=this.checked;
   document.querySelectorAll('tr[data-grade]').forEach(function(tr){
     var g=tr.getAttribute('data-grade');
     if(g==='stretched'||g==='parabolic') tr.style.display = hide ? 'none' : '';
   }); });
})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
